From 620f1d25c0b1d05660d5ee152d7cea2d82af1b96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ClaudeBox <claudebox@local>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 16:49:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fork: O10 livedocs gather-time skip (search_skip / dead_set /
 doc_indices_for_ids) on dotvbyte mmap shards

Separate search_raw_skip body seeds the traversal's visited set with dead
forward-range starts; search/search_raw/search_raw_visited untouched.
Unit test livedocs_skip_exact_and_bound.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
